10	// These tests protect the recovery workflow documented in the README: a write
11	// failure can strike in the middle of persisting a multi-node batch, leaving
12	// some nodes' new records durably saved and others not yet saved. The command
13	// must report the failure with new=0 duplicate=0 (it must not present the
